    m = (i a sinθ, 0, 1, i/sinθ)/(√2 q),   m̄ = (−i a sinθ, 0, 1, −i/sinθ)/(√2 q̄)

(contravariant components in the order `t, r, θ, φ`; the Kinnersley tetrad of Hintz arXiv:2609.33661v1 with the same
vectors). Frame index `A = 0, 1, 2, 3` ↔ `l, n, m, m̄`; `knT` has the frame vectors as **columns**.

